## Snippets

Some text that was wrapped by an editor at a fixed width of about eighty characters per line, which the import should join back into one line.

```html
<p>This HTML is inside a code fence
and must be left exactly as it is.</p>
```

    indented code is also
    left alone

- a list item that is long enough that it was wrapped onto the next line by
  the editor, and stays that way
- second item

> a quote that is also long enough to have been wrapped at the edge of the
> screen by the mail program

| col a | col b |
|-------|-------|
| 1     | 2     |

A line with a hard break at the end that must never be joined to the next  
one, even though it is long enough.
